ly</span>: Yes, I saw a brochure at the mall. <br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Vanessa</span>: And?", "id": 1, "time": "7000", "image": "engenn3le04ob02re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, there are many attractions and landmarks in Mexico City.<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Like what? <br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: The monuments and architecture. You could go with a tour guide!<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Tour guide? I don't know ... I prefer to travel alone.", "id": 2, "time": "21000", "image": "engenn3le04ob02re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, how about visiting the ancient ruins?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You mean, I have to take a bus or car? <br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: Yeah ...<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Mmm, I'd rather not. It sounds like too much work ... it's a holiday! I want sun and sand!<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: So, why not go to the beach, have a cold drink and enjoy the view?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Vanessa</span>: That's what I'm talking about! I plan to! You should come, too!", "id": 3, "time": "38500", "image": "engenn3le04ob02re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn3le04ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn3le04ob02re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}